flowchart TB
  accTitle: Isolated application recovery
  accDescr: Begin with read-only B2 access and recovery credentials from outside the cluster. Restore to fresh volumes in a default-deny namespace, import database exports, and verify data and application behavior before directing production traffic to the recovered application.
  B2[("B2 backup + recovery keys<br/>Read-only backup access")]:::offsite
  Isolate["Isolated recovery namespace<br/>Default-deny networking"]:::step
  Restore["Restore fresh PVCs + secrets<br/>Keep production routes + jobs out"]:::storage
  DB["Import database exports<br/>Compatible database version"]:::step
  Test["Read files + objects<br/>Check data + application requests"]:::step
  Cutover["Production cutover<br/>After application validation"]:::step
  B2 --> Isolate --> Restore --> DB --> Test --> Cutover
  classDef step fill:#ffffff,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#0f172a,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef storage fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#86b99e,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef offsite fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#a5b4fc,color:#3730a3,stroke-width:1.5px
